{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3aa8cb83661429c7c9cad107d5015e5d9ada8cbd6bb3aa29fe5b81112208dce5", "ja": "紬、新しい衣装はどうだ？\n何か問題はないか？", "zh": "紬，新衣服感觉怎么样？没有什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0164_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a714e3c8e1d80e08c0ad8446a259a2439eb1549ca7b22fa5ac9eb98294f79138", "ja": "{$P$}。い、いえ、問題ありません。\n私にはもったいないくらい、美しいお衣装かと……。", "zh": "{$P$}。不、不，没问题。\n这套华美的服装，对我来说实在太过奢侈了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
